        <mxCell id="__ts" value="Every box is a Flux Kustomization under clusters/aws-0/ or clusters/gcp-0/. Arrows are spec.dependsOn — Flux will not apply a Kustomization until the ones it points at are Ready. A path written aws-0 · gcp-0 is per-cluster: each cluster applies its own overlay of the same shared base." style="text;html=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=13;fontColor=#64748B;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
